// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Group / module definition
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/**
 * @defgroup StEtrFastSimMaker ETR Fast Simulator
 * @brief Fast digitisation of Monte Carlo hits for the STAR Endcap Tracking
 *        (ETR) prototype detector.
 *
 * @section etr_overview Overview
 *
 * The **ETR** (Endcap Tracking, prototype) is a forward-endcap tracking
 * detector studied within the STAR experiment framework.  It is modelled as
 * a Transition-Radiation-Detector (TRD)-like stack with three disk layers,
 * each divided into twelve azimuthal sectors, and each sector further
 * subdivided into up to thirty pad sections.
 *
 * Geometry summary:
 *   - **Layers**  (radial disks)  : 3  (iLayer = 0, 1, 2)
 *   - **Sectors** (azimuthal)     : 12 (iSector = 0–11)
 *   - **Sections** (pad sections) : up to 100 per sector/layer
 *
 * The detector volume identifier used in the GEANT hit table encodes all
 * three indices:
 * @code
 *   volume_id = section + 100 * layer + 10000 * sector
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section etr_fastsim Fast Simulation
 *
 * A *fast simulator* replaces the full GEANT/GSTAR digitisation chain
 * (charge sharing, ADC response, cluster finding) with a parametric
 * smearing step, dramatically reducing CPU cost for large-scale production
 * simulations.
 *
 * `StEtrFastSimMaker` performs the following steps each event:
 *
 * 1. Retrieves `StEvent` from the input data stream.
 * 2. Obtains (or creates) the `StEtrHitCollection` within that `StEvent`.
 * 3. Reads the GEANT Monte Carlo hit table `g2t_etr_hit` from the `"geant"`
 *    input dataset.
 * 4. For every row in `g2t_etr_hit`:
 *    -# Extracts the true global Cartesian hit position \f$(x, y, z)\f$.
 *    -# Applies independent Gaussian smearing to \f$x\f$ and \f$y\f$
 *       with \f$\sigma = 300\,\mu\text{m}\f$ (no smearing applied in
 *       \f$z\f$, which is determined by the disk geometry).
 *    -# Decodes `volume_id` into `section`, `layer`, and `sector`.
 *    -# Constructs an `StEtrHit` from the smeared position, geometry
 *       indices, and the deposited energy `de`.
 *    -# Attaches MC truth track association via `StHit::setIdTruth()`.
 *    -# Inserts the hit into the `StEtrHitCollection`.
 * 5. Optionally renders all ETR hits in a 3-D event display
 *    (`StuDraw3DEvent`) when the compile-time flag `etrDraw != 0`.
 *
 * @section etr_inputs Inputs
 *
 * | Dataset key   | Type                  | Description                            |
 * |---------------|-----------------------|----------------------------------------|
 * | `"StEvent"`   | `StEvent*`            | Reconstructed event container          |
 * | `"geant"`     | `TDataSet` (iterator) | GEANT output tables                    |
 * | `"geant/g2t_etr_hit"` | `St_g2t_etr_hit*` | Per-hit GEANT truth table         |
 *
 * @section etr_outputs Outputs
 *
 * | Container                | Location in `StEvent`              | Description                   |
 * |--------------------------|------------------------------------|-------------------------------|
 * | `StEtrHitCollection`     | `StEvent::etrHitCollection()`      | Collection of smeared ETR hits |
 *
 * @section etr_params Detector Resolution Parameters
 *
 * The transverse position resolution is controlled by `mErr[0]` (\f$\sigma_x\f$)
 * and `mErr[1]` (\f$\sigma_y\f$), both initialised to
 * \f$3 \times 10^{-2}\,\text{cm} = 300\,\mu\text{m}\f$.
 * The longitudinal component `mErr[2]` (\f$\sigma_z\f$) is set to zero.
 *
 * @note The `InitRun()` log message reads "Smearing SVT hits" — this is a
 *       copy-paste artefact from an SVT-based template; the maker smears
 *       **ETR** hits.
 *
 * @section etr_history Revision History
 *
 * | Revision | Date       | Author | Note                        |
 * |----------|------------|--------|-----------------------------|
 * | 1.1      | 2012-03-22 | perev  | Initial version             |
 * | 1.2      | 2012-04-10 | perev  | Position errors set to 300 µm |
 * | 1.3      | 2012-07-21 | perev  | `IdTruth` propagation added |
 *
 * @ingroup StEtrFastSimMaker
 */

